            </note>
            <note corresp="#d111-f5" n="5" xml:id="d111-f5-content">
                <p>Not printed, but see footnote 4, Document 109.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d111-f6" n="6" xml:id="d111-f6-content">
                <p>Not printed, but see <hi rendition="#italic">ibid</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d111-f7" n="7" xml:id="d111-f7-content">
                <p>In telegram 255 to Trieste, September 7, the Department of State informed Unger
                    that his recommendation was not approved because it would lead to an involvement
                    in the substance of the contention which the Department wanted to avoid at that
                    time. (750G.00/9–751)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
